===== no package and no --pull =====

===== installer setup --work-dir $EMPTY --non-interactive --namespace x =====
--- stdout
--- stderr
Error: no package found in $EMPTY/package — pass --pull <ref> to fetch one, --space <slug> to re-enter an install from its installer record, or `installer pull <ref> --work-dir $EMPTY` first
--- error
no package found in $EMPTY/package — pass --pull <ref> to fetch one, --space <slug> to re-enter an install from its installer record, or `installer pull <ref> --work-dir $EMPTY` first

===== a --pull that cannot be read =====

===== installer setup --work-dir $BADPULL --pull $PKG_V1/missing --non-interactive --namespace x =====
--- stdout
--- stderr
Error: pull $PKG_V1/missing: stat $PKG_V1/missing: no such file or directory
--- error
pull $PKG_V1/missing: stat $PKG_V1/missing: no such file or directory

===== fresh install without --namespace =====

===== installer setup --pull $PKG_V1 --work-dir $NONS --non-interactive =====
--- stdout
--- stderr
Error: --namespace is required in non-interactive mode
--- error
--namespace is required in non-interactive mode

===== --components with --select =====

===== installer setup --pull $PKG_V1 --work-dir $BOTH --non-interactive --namespace x --components all --select monitoring =====
--- stdout
--- stderr
Error: --components and --select are mutually exclusive
--- error
--components and --select are mutually exclusive

===== --reuse with nothing to reuse =====

===== installer setup --pull $PKG_V1 --work-dir $NOREUSE --reuse =====
--- stdout
--- stderr
Error: --reuse requires a prior install — none found in this work-dir
--- error
--reuse requires a prior install — none found in this work-dir

===== an unknown component =====

===== installer setup --pull $PKG_V1 --work-dir $NOCOMP --non-interactive --namespace x --select no-such-component =====
--- stdout
--- stderr
Error: resolve selection: unknown component "no-such-component" (declared in hello-app)
--- error
resolve selection: unknown component "no-such-component" (declared in hello-app)

