===== upgrade adds a required input =====

===== installer setup --pull $PKG_REQUIRED --work-dir $WORK --non-interactive =====
--- stdout
Loaded prior install state from local.
--- stderr
Error: the new package adds 1 required input(s) that the prior install did not answer:
  - owner (string): Who owns the app
pass --input <name>=<value> for each, or run `installer setup --work-dir $WORK` on a terminal to be asked.
--- error
the new package adds 1 required input(s) that the prior install did not answer:
  - owner (string): Who owns the app
pass --input <name>=<value> for each, or run `installer setup --work-dir $WORK` on a terminal to be asked.

===== tree package after the failed upgrade =====
--- bases/default/deployment.yaml (content not compared)
--- bases/default/kustomization.yaml (content not compared)
--- bases/default/namespace.yaml (content not compared)
--- bases/default/service.yaml (content not compared)
--- components/ingress-tls/kustomization.yaml (content not compared)
--- components/ingress/ingress.yaml (content not compared)
--- components/ingress/kustomization.yaml (content not compared)
--- components/monitoring/kustomization.yaml (content not compared)
--- components/monitoring/servicemonitor.yaml (content not compared)
--- installer.yaml
apiVersion: installer.confighub.com/v1alpha1
kind: Package
metadata:
  name: hello-app
installerMetadata:
  version: 0.1.0
spec:
  bases:
    - name: default
      path: bases/default
      default: true
      description: A minimal app — Namespace, Deployment, Service.

  inputs:
    - name: team
      type: string
      default: core
      description: Team that owns the app.

  components:
    - name: monitoring
      path: components/monitoring
      description: Adds a ServiceMonitor for Prometheus scraping.
      externalRequires:
        - kind: CRD
          name: servicemonitors.monitoring.coreos.com
          suggestedSource: oci://ghcr.io/prometheus-community/charts/kube-prometheus-stack
    - name: ingress
      path: components/ingress
      description: Adds an Ingress so the app is reachable from outside the cluster.
    - name: ingress-tls
      path: components/ingress-tls
      description: Annotates the Ingress to request a cert from cert-manager.
      requires: [ingress]
      externalRequires:
        - kind: WebhookCertProvider
          name: cert-manager
          issuerKind: ClusterIssuer

  transformers:
    # Rename the Namespace resource and set metadata.namespace on every
    # namespace-scoped resource. The namespace comes from the wizard's
    # --namespace flag.
    - toolchain: Kubernetes/YAML
      whereResource: ""
      description: Set the namespace on every namespaced resource.
      invocations:
        - name: set-namespace
          args: ["{{ .Namespace }}"]

